/**
 * slides.mjs — the sixteen slides of the training deck.
 *
 * AUTHORED. `page` is the page of *Training: Map of Monotropic Experiences with
 * presenter notes* the slide is rendered from; ten of the PDF's 26 pages are notes
 * continuations and carry no slide. `alt` is written by hand, because alt text is
 * content — it is the slide for anyone who cannot see it, and it must be reviewable
 * in one place rather than scattered through the prose.
 *
 * The slide IMAGES are generated by `tools/make-slides.py` and their dimensions live
 * in the generated `images/slides/manifest.json`. Never hand-edit either.
 *
 * THE SOURCE PDF IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY. It is 62 MB and it is published by
 * Autistic Realms; `make-slides.py` fetches it. A regeneration therefore needs the
 * network, and `--check` says so rather than reporting a pass it did not earn.
 */
